## 📱 Usage Example

The notification system now works seamlessly:

```javascript
// In your code
const firebaseConfig = require('./src/config/firebase');

// Send to multiple users
const tokens = ['token1', 'token2', 'token3'];
const notification = {
  title: 'New Event!',
  body: 'Something exciting happened'
};

const result = await firebaseConfig.sendMulticastNotification(tokens, notification, {
  type: 'event',
  eventId: '123'
});

console.log(`Sent: ${result.successCount}, Failed: ${result.failureCount}`);
```

